    "Construct/configure outside tree where possible; tag setup signals separately and drain at explicit deferred marker before arming.",
    "Before arming each evaluation, capture actual child IDs/order, modifier bindings/settings, skeleton/target transforms, bone parent/rest/local/global poses.",
    "Arm one evaluation then call advance once; record immediate return as sequencing only, never final-pose evidence.",
    "Record modification_processed emitter IDs and both bone poses; exactly two matching ordered stage events for armed evaluation.",
    "Capture final poses in skeleton_updated only after both expected stage events. Reject extra/missing armed events.",
    "Schedule continuation via call_deferred from final signal; do not treat await signal resumption as after restore. Record restored poses in that continuation.",
    "Reset identical base input and reorder same direct children for second evaluation; setup/reconfiguration drain is explicitly tagged and excluded from the two manual evaluations. No adaptive warmups.",
    "After second restored snapshot emit one RESULT_JSON then exit. Retain setup events in trace."
